  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Quand Munna mange un rêve, celui-ci\nest aussitôt oublié par le rêveur.\nIl lévite en permanence.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Munna always float in the air. People\nwhose dreams are eaten by them\nforget what the dreams had been about.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se nourrit des rêves des gens et des\nPokémon. Quand le rêve est agréable,\nil crache une fumée rose.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It eats the dreams of people and\nPokémon. When it eats a pleasant\ndream, it expels pink-colored mist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon appears before people\nand Pokémon who are having nightmares\nand eats those dreams.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon appears before people\nand Pokémon who are having nightmares\nand eats those dreams.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "わるい　ゆめに　うなされている\nポケモンや　ひとの　まえに　あらわれ\nそのゆめを　たべてしまう　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "나쁜 꿈에 시달리고 있는\n포켓몬이나 사람 앞에 나타나\n그 꿈을 먹어버리는 포켓몬.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il apparaît aux humains et aux Pokémon qui font\ndes mauvais rêves et mange leurs cauchemars pour\nles en libérer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es erscheint vor schlafenden Menschen\nund Pokémon und frisst ihre Alpträume.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cuando un humano o un Pokémon sufre una pesadilla,\nMunna se aparece ante ellos y la engulle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Compare accanto a Pokémon e uomini tormentati\ndagli incubi per nutrirsi di tutti i loro brutti sogni.",
