      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "깊은 밤중 머리맡에 나타난다.\n꿈을 먹는 동안 몸에 있는\n무늬가 어렴풋이 빛난다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會在深夜出現在枕頭邊。\n在吃夢的時候，\n身上的花紋會微微發亮。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il apparaît en pleine nuit, à côté de l’oreiller.\nQuand il se nourrit de rêves, les motifs\nde son corps luisent légèrement.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tief in der Nacht erscheint es am Kopfende von\nBetten. Während es einen Traum frisst, schimmert\ndas Muster auf seinem Körper.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aparece en plena noche junto a la almohada\nde la gente. Cuando devora los sueños, los\nmotivos de su cuerpo emiten una luz tenue.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Appare vicino al guanciale nel cuore della notte.\nQuando mangia i sogni, i motivi che ha sul\ncorpo si illuminano lievemente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Late at night, it appears beside people’s pillows.\nAs it feeds on dreams, the patterns on its body\ngive off a faint glow.",
      "language": {
