    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "深夜　枕元に　現れる。\n夢を　食べているとき　体の\n模様が　ぼんやりと　光る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会在深夜出现在枕头边。\n在吃梦的时候，\n身上的花纹会微微发亮。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Aparece en plena noche junto a la almohada\nde la gente. Cuando devora los sueños, los\nmotivos de su cuerpo emiten una luz tenue.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ゆめを　たべて　けむりを　はく。\nたのしい　ゆめなら　ピンクいろで\nあくむの　ときは　くろっぽいぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꿈을 먹고 연기를 내뿜는다.\n즐거운 꿈이면 핑크색이고\n악몽이면 거무스름하다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在吃掉夢之後會吐出煙霧。\n吃了快樂的夢時，煙霧是粉紅色的；\n如果是惡夢，煙霧則是黑灰色的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se nourrit de songes et expire de la fumée\nqui prend la couleur rose si le rêve est joyeux,\nou noire s’il s’agit d’un cauchemar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Während es Träume frisst, stößt es Dunst aus.\nBei fröhlichen Träumen ist dieser rosafarben,\nbei Alpträumen schwärzlich.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El humo que despide cambia de color en función\ndel sueño que haya consumido. Si es alegre, será\nrosa, o negruzco en el caso de una pesadilla.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si nutre di sogni. Esala un fumo rosa se sono\nsogni piacevoli e nero se sono incubi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
